# Django stuff:
*.log
# ...but a plan's captured evidence is tracked source, not a stray runtime log.
# `*.log` had silently swallowed three benchmark captures in Plan 00154's
# assets/results/, alongside nine tracked siblings, while RESEARCH.md cited the
# directory and CLAUDE.md quotes the numbers those captures back. Scoped rather
# than un-ignoring CLAUDE/Plan/ wholesale, so check_repo_hygiene's
# ignored-plan-document rule keeps its teeth for the next over-broad pattern.
!CLAUDE/Plan/**/*.log
local_settings.py
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal

